    <span class="text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-emerald-700 dark:text-emerald-400">Discovery Sprint</span>
    <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold text-slate-950 dark:text-white mt-2">Fieldwork &amp; Situational Journey Mapping</h3>
    <div class="space-y-4 text-base text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-300 leading-relaxed mt-5">
      <p>Our research team spent five days conducting situated contextual inquiries across central Lisbon multimodal stations. By combining stationary dwell-time observations with 14 semi-structured intercept interviews with university students, we documented how departure timing, weather variations, and real-time transit uncertainty dictate mobility choices.</p>
      <p>Rather than treating sustainable transit choices as deliberate calculations, commuters act primarily out of deeply ingrained cognitive routines.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

